MSH ─ Message Header
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – message-level notes)
PID ─ Patient Identification
 ├─ PD1 (optional – patient additional demographics)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – patient comments)
 ├─ NK1 (optional, repeating – next of kin/associated parties)
PV1 ─ Patient Visit
 ├─ PV2 (optional – additional visit info)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – visit-level comments)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – attending/consulting roles)
 ├─ DG1 (optional, repeating – diagnosis)
 ├─ DRG (optional, repeating – diagnosis related group)
 ├─ AL1 (optional, repeating – allergies)
 ├─ PR1 (optional, repeating – procedures)
 ├─ GT1 (optional, repeating – guarantor)
 ├─ IN1 (optional, repeating – insurance)
 │   ├─ IN2 (optional – additional insurance info)
 │   └─ IN3 (optional, repeating – certification info)
 ├─ ACC (optional – accident info)
 ├─ UB1 (optional – billing)
 ├─ UB2 (optional – billing continuation)
 └─ Zxx (optional – custom/local segments)
ORC ─ Common Order (repeating group)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – order-level comments)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – order-level roles)
 ├─ OBR (Observation Request – repeating group)
 │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation notes)
 │   ├─ ROL (optional, repeating)
 │   ├─ OBX (Observation Result – repeating)
 │   │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation result notes)
 │   ├─ TCD (optional – test code details)
 │   ├─ SPM (optional – specimen details)
 │   │   ├─ OBX (optional, repeating – specimen observation)
 │   │   │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating)
 │   └─ SAC (optional, repeating – specimen container info)
 ├─ FT1 (optional, repeating – financial transaction)
 └─ Zxx (optional, repeating – custom extension)
OBX ─ Observation/Result (if sent outside OBR)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – result-level comments)
DG1 ─ Diagnosis
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – diagnosis notes)
AL1 ─ Allergy Information
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – allergy notes)
PR1 ─ Procedures
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – procedure notes)
GT1 ─ Guarantor
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – guarantor comments)
IN1 ─ Insurance
 ├─ IN2 (optional)
 ├─ IN3 (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – insurance notes)
ACC ─ Accident
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – accident comments)
UB1 ─ Universal Bill 1 (optional)
UB2 ─ Universal Bill 2 (optional)
Zxx ─ Site-specific custom extension segments (optional)
